{#
  Posts as a Markdown list, one line each in the shape a listing's Markdown
  has: `- [YYYY-MM-DD Title](url)`, with the description after a colon when
  the post has one.

  Set `postList` before including it. Each entry is a `label`, a `url`, a
  `date` (a `Date`, written in the site's timezone) and a `description`, the
  shape `newestPosts(count)` gives on a static front page:

    {% set postList = newestPosts(5) %}
    {% include "partials/markdown-post-list.md.njk" %}
-#}
{% for entry in postList %}
- [{{ ((((entry.date | date("html")) + " ") if entry.date) + entry.label) | escapeMarkdown }}]({{ entry.url | markdownUrl }}){{ (": " + (entry.description | escapeMarkdown)) if entry.description }}
{% endfor %}
